{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">名古屋亞運，賽艇港隊的張苑珊、梁穎桉，以及武術散打的梁宇航奪銀。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁宇航在男子60公斤級金牌戰，不敵國家隊選手唐思碩，仍為港隊歷史性在武術散打取得銀牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"JS.AG.SILVER-1000.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026V9zBWPXX8S1790220525.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"JS.AG.SILVER-1000.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">張菀珊、梁穎桉在女子輕量級雙人雙槳造出6分59秒24，力壓日本，同樣取得銀牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.AG.SILVER-1000_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026fI466qX7Zc1790220563.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.AG.SILVER-1000_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T03:38:30.292233+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}